---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Contact"
    description="How to reach Vaibhav Kubre: email, social profiles, and what to expect."
>
    <main id="main" class="py-8 space-y-6 text-xs md:text-sm text-carbon leading-6">
        <h1 class="uppercase text-2xl font-bold text-carbon-lighter">Contact</h1>

        <p>
            The fastest way to reach Vaibhav is email at
            <a class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40" href="mailto:v@kubre.in?subject=Hello"
                >v@kubre.in</a
            >. Put something specific in the subject line — "collab", "hiring", or the project name
            both work — and he will see it. Email is the only channel he treats as a promise;
            everything below is best-effort.
        </p>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-carbon-lighter">
                Good reasons to write
            </h2>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
                <li>Work inquiries, consulting, or full-time roles.</li>
                <li>
                    Questions about <a class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40" href="/work/"
                        >projects</a
                    > or <a
                        class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40"
                        href="https://github.com/kubre/scrcap">scrcap</a
                    >, including bug reports and feature requests (GitHub issues are even better).
                </li>
                <li>Speaking, writing, or podcast invitations.</li>
                <li>Corrections to anything published on this site.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-carbon-lighter">Elsewhere</h2>
            <p>
                He posts occasionally on
                <a class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40" href="https://linkedin.com/in/kubre"
                    >LinkedIn</a
                >, publishes code on <a
                    class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40"
                    href="https://github.com/kubre">GitHub</a
                >, and writes shorter notes on <a
                    class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40"
                    href="https://x.com/kubre_in">X</a
                >. For a full list of profiles, use the links in the footer of any page on this
                site.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
